                                "sense_id": "1652af80-9878-3e0e-856d-2d84b664b493",
                                "text": "So Brad McLaughlin mingled reckless talk\nOf heavenly stars with hugger-mugger farming,\nTill having failed at hugger-mugger farming,\nHe burned his house down for the fire insurance\nAnd spent the proceeds on a telescope […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ed10a8d-3a58-46f7-93c2-5736b30e2811",
                                "sense_id": "1652af80-9878-3e0e-856d-2d84b664b493",
                                "text": "There were densely tenanted houses on the main road, pigsties hugger-mugger with people, fireplace ashes thrown out at night."
                            }
